{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022231720708-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022232911\"/><p>中電人員拖臨時電線入村。</p><p>今日(22日)晚上9時許，西貢沙角尾舊村有數十住戶停電。中電人員接報到場進行搶修，並拖臨時電線，隨後會安排逐條巷恢復供電，據報目標1至2小時內全部巷恢復供電。中電表示正安排復電工作中。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.140354+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:17:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:57:59.261751+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:14.700770+00:00","content_hash":"067fd41b8c9341b3b453dca440f0b259d66aab5bdbf715ade0dd478c8ce998ec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.140354+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}